# D3-SU-006: Doping can change electrical properties without a visible bulk-density change
# Simulation candidate; no runtime observations are claimed.
register lv3
new
new
add v1 silicon 1g
add v2 doped_silicon 1g
add v3 Cu 1g
measure v1 conductivity
measure v2 conductivity
measure v3 conductivity
measure v1 density
measure v2 density
look v1
look v2
inspect
